cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use krt, please cite it as below."
title: "krt: Author, Validate, and Export Key Resources Tables"
abstract: >-
  An R toolkit for authoring, validating, enriching, rendering, and depositing
  Key Resources Tables (KRTs), built around a neutral typed core schema and a
  registry of output profiles (generic, ASAP, STAR Methods), with identifier
  normalization and resolution, manuscript extraction, provenance, and FAIR
  outputs.
type: software
